<div class="insight"><p><strong>Frustration profiles shift dramatically with company size.</strong> Small companies struggle most with sourcing (32%) and candidate quality issues (ghosting 16%, unqualified applicants 16%). Mid-market frustrations center on workflow problems: scheduling (26%), analytics (23%), and sourcing (23%). Enterprise companies face infrastructure pain: analytics (33%), integration (23%), and compliance (23%). BambooHR's product roadmap should prioritize analytics and scheduling for the mid-market target, not the sourcing problems that dominate its current small-company base.</p></div>

<div class="crosstab-section">
<h3>Competitive Landscape by Company Size</h3>
<p>Column percentages: for each size segment, the percentage of non-users who included each brand in their consideration set. Shaded cells are the top 2 values in each column.</p>
